sequenceDiagram
    participant Trainer
    participant ReactApp
    participant CourseAPI
    participant Database

    Trainer->>ReactApp: Select materials from library
    ReactApp->>CourseAPI: POST /api/courses
    CourseAPI->>Database: Insert Course draft
    CourseAPI->>Database: Link CourseMaterial rows
    CourseAPI->>Database: Insert MaterialUsageLog
    Trainer->>ReactApp: Set credit price and publish
    ReactApp->>CourseAPI: PUT publish course
    CourseAPI->>Database: Update Course status Published
    CourseAPI-->>ReactApp: 200 OK
    ReactApp-->>Trainer: Program visible in catalog
